### TC-RES-06 1차 답변 4개 → 400 INVALID_ANSWER_COUNT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/results
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "surveyId": 1,
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 2, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 3, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 4, "score": 0 }
  ]
}

### TC-RES-07 score = 3 → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (fields에 answers[0].score)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/results
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "surveyId": 1,
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "score": 3 },
    { "questionId": 2, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 3, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 4, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 5, "score": 0 }
  ]
}

### TC-RES-08 1차 제출에 2차 문항 id(6) 포함 → 404 QUESTION_NOT_FOUND
POST http://localhost:8080/api/results
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "surveyId": 1,
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 2, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 3, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 4, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 5, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 6, "score": 0 }
  ]
}

### TC-RES-09 본인 HighRisk 결과 상세 → 200, memberId, solutions 1건 이상 (TC-RES-04 먼저 실행)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/results/{{highRisk.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### TC-RES-10 본인 Normal 결과 상세 → 200, solutions = [] (TC-RES-01 먼저 실행)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/results/{{normal.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 없는 결과(또는 다른 회원·삭제된 결과) → 404 RESULT_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/api/results/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 내 검사 이력 → 200, 최신순 content + page (마이페이지는 size=100)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/results?page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 토큰 없이 제출 → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "surveyId": 1,
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 2, "score": 0 },
    { "questionId": 3, "score": 1 },
    { "questionId": 4, "score": 1 },
    { "questionId": 5, "score": 1 }
  ]
}
